                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 25.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;">
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在刚刚过去的2025年盛夏，绍兴一中航模社团的同学们乘风破浪、奋勇争先，先后在浙江省青少年航海模型锦标赛和全国青少年航海模型锦标赛中屡创佳绩，展现了出色的科技素养与顽强的拼搏精神！</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>一、省赛先声夺人：宁波象山赛场表现亮眼</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2025年7月6日至9日，浙江省青少年航海模型锦标赛在宁波象山举行。面对台风、高温、湖面风浪等多重挑战，我校航模队团结协作、沉着应战，团队与个人荣誉双丰收，不仅绍兴市代表队获评 “体育道德风尚奖”，社团成员祝绍童、俞鹏程两位同学也凭借良好赛场风貌，双双斩获“体育道德风尚奖”。在竞技项目中，学子们多点开花：</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">许诗宇    F1-E 第三名；       FSR-E 第四名</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">钟麒竣    F5-S900 第四名；  （F5-400+F5-550）项目团体 第四名</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">章星宇    F3-V 第四名</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">陈玥     （F5-400+F5-550）项目团体 第四名</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0.29in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.00in;"><span style="font-family: undefined;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">黄天泽    FSR-O3.5  少年组第四名</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="font-family: undefined;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">青年组第五名</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">傅泽宇    F3-E 第五名；       F3-V 第五名</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">王鹏泽    MiNi-HYDRO 第六名</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">俞鹏程    F4-A 第七名</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">王熠      MiNi-ECO 第七名</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>二、国赛再传捷报：浙江丽水赛场</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>继续</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>突破</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2025年8月15日至22日，全国青少年航海模型锦标赛在浙江丽水举行。带着省赛积累的经验与信心，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴一中航模社团学子向这场参赛人数超千人的全国性赛事发起冲击。比赛期间，高温炙烤、场地分散等不利因素给选手们带来多重挑战，但我校4名参赛学子始终秉持顽强拼搏的精神，凭借扎实的训练功底与灵活的临场应变，最终突破重围，将多项全国性荣誉收入囊中。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">赛场上，个人风采与团体协作相得益彰：俞鹏程同学延续良好赛场作风，获评“体育道德风尚奖”；沈楷乘、章后来、黄天泽三位同学则在竞技项目中精准发挥，用稳定的操作展现出扎实的航模技能，为团队荣誉再添助力。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">获奖名单如下：</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">俞鹏程    体育道德风尚奖</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">沈楷乘    F3团体第五名     F3- V 第六名</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">  </span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">       </span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> MINI-ECO-Q  少年组三等奖</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">章后来    F3团体第五名     F4-A 少年组三等奖</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">黄天泽    F3- V 第八名</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>三、荣誉背后，是坚持与热爱</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一次次调试模型、一遍遍模拟训练、一场场实战比拼……荣誉的背后，是同学们对航海模型运动的热爱与坚持，是教练员老师们的辛勤指导，也是家长和班主任老师的默默支持。未来，绍兴一中航模社团将继续秉持 “勇于探索、敢于挑战”的精神，在航模领域不断突破，为校争光、为梦想续航！</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">让我们再次为所有获奖同学表示热烈祝贺</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">!感谢指导教练沈祥土老师的辛苦付出！</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">  </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">愿绍兴一中航模社团继续扬帆远航，再创辉煌！</span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/9/202509010829042906.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202509010829042906.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/9/202509010829048098.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202509010829048098.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/9/202509010829183338.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202509010829183338.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/9/202509010829188888.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202509010829188888.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/9/202509010829185300.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202509010829185300.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/9/202509010829187354.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202509010829187354.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/9/202509010829192376.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202509010829192376.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/9/202509010829202166.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202509010829202166.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/9/202509010829217324.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202509010829217324.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/9/202509010829206546.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202509010829206546.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/9/202509010829209889.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202509010829209889.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/9/202509010829211052.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202509010829211052.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/9/202509010829215640.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202509010829215640.png" /></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: right;">
</p>
    
